 heading('Introduction'),paragraph('The derivative is one of the main tools of calculus. It is instantaneous rate of change of a function at a point in the domain. It is same like the gradient or slope of the tangent line to the graph of the function at that point. Before going to the definition we need to revise the concept of limit introduced in previous unit of this book.'),
